ZVSE2

** HENCHMEN GROWTH - PRE HANDLERS
**
** The "30" prefix makes this script load BEFORE "29 wog - henchmen.erm", so these
** handlers run before the Enhanced Henchmen ones for the same function.
** Enhanced Henchmen caps the henchman stack to 2 creatures after every action.
** Here we remember the real quantity, and "-2000 henchmen growth.erm" restores it.

!?FU(hench_ManageDeadOrAlive)&i^hg_growthEnabled^;   [option 950, read in "-2000 henchmen growth.erm"]
!#VA(stack:x) (side:x);

!!VRi^hg_preNum_%(side)^:S0;
!!VRi^hg_preLost_%(side)^:S0;
!!FU&(stack)<=(NO_STACK):E;

!!BM(stack):N?i^hg_preNum_%(side)^ L?i^hg_preLost_%(side)^;

; Henchman info dialog: mark that the dialog is being built, so "-2000 henchmen growth.erm"
; adds the victories / quantity lines to it. Cleared again after the dialog.
!?FU(hench_ShowHenchDlg)&i^hg_growthEnabled^;
!!VRi^hg_inHenchDlg^:S(TRUE);
